WEBVTT

00:00.160 --> 00:05.400
After the Yiyang battle zhao took my military command drove my tribe out.

00:06.000 --> 00:11.640
Now I can only lead my tribe wandering begging to survive I know.

00:11.960 --> 00:16.360
Your Highness wants to attack Nandu but troubled by Qingzhou Army's restraint.

00:16.920 --> 00:18.440
I'm also a commander.

00:19.160 --> 00:21.200
Naturally can see the current situation.

00:22.160 --> 00:26.960
My tribe has many skilled fighters only lacking weapons and food.

00:27.200 --> 00:32.347
If Your Highness can give us two thousand sets of armor one thousand warhorses one hundred days of rations.

00:32.880 --> 00:35.520
I will block Qingzhou Army for Your Highness.

